(typically utilizing alpha-helical bundles \(e.g., bacteriorhodopsin, GPCRs with 7) Tj
T*
(transmembrane helices\) or beta-barrels \(e.g., porins in bacterial and mitochondrial) Tj
T*
(outer membranes\).) Tj
