(to beta-lactam antibiotics.) Tj
T*
(Answer: Gram-positive cell walls have a thick \(20-80 nm\) multi-layered peptidoglycan) Tj
T*
(meshwork laced with teichoic and lipoteichoic acids, directly exposed to the external) Tj
T*
(medium. Gram-negative envelopes feature a thin \(2-7 nm\) single-layered peptidoglycan) Tj
